* LTC6252 High-Speed Amplifier Gain of 2
V1 VCC 0 5
V2 VEE 0 -5
V3 IN 0 SINE(0 1 10Meg)

R1 OUT IN_MINUS 499
R2 IN_MINUS 0 499

X1 IN IN_MINUS VCC VEE OUT LTC6252

.tran 0 1u 0.5u 100p

.meas tran in_max MAX V(IN)
.meas tran in_min MIN V(IN)
.meas tran in_pp param in_max-in_min
.meas tran out_max MAX V(OUT)
.meas tran out_min MIN V(OUT)
.meas tran out_pp param out_max-out_min
.meas tran gain_db param 20*log10(out_pp/in_pp)

.end
